# Custom (local) Snort rules, managed by luci-app-snort.
#
# These rules are loaded in addition to the downloaded rule set when the
# configuration mode is "Managed by LuCI".  Use SIDs >= 1000000 for your own
# rules.  Example:
#
# alert icmp any any -> $HOME_NET any (msg:"LOCAL ICMP ping to home network"; itype:8; sid:1000001; rev:1;)
